meta {
  name: get project
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}projects/:id/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 1
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Project detail (FR-8.4). Any role. `consumption` lists each component with
  quantity taken, returned and net consumed, plus estimated value (net
  quantity x the component's last buying price). Also shows
  `total_estimated_value` and the linked `requisitions`.


  ## API example response
  {
